HB0035 Vacancies in elected office.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman and Larson, JT and
Senator(s) Anderson and Crum
AN ACT relating to elections; amending procedures for filling vacancies in
specified federal and state offices; requiring special elections as specified;
making conforming amendments; repealing obsolete provisions; and providing for
an effective date.
